{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52157","headline":"五言侍宴延庆殿同赋别题得阿阁凤应诏 · 许敬宗","name":"五言侍宴延庆殿同赋别题得阿阁凤应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝台凌紫雾，仙凤下丹霄。\n层巢依绮阁，清歌入洞箫。\n逸彩桐[间]艳，浮声竹外娇。\n自欣栖大厦，率儛爲闻韶。\n（同前）（按：本诗原署：「银青光禄大夫行右庶子高阳县开国男弘文馆学士臣许敬宗上。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}